":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","login":"Bromeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon"},"body":"Does changing from `int` to enum actually break binary compatibility? Seems to me that the FFI representation should be the same :thinking: \r\n\r\nOr is this a shortcoming of the compatibility mechanism, which treats enum and int as different?\r\n\r\n(Obviously it does break source compatibility in situations where GDExtension bindings generate strongly typed enums, but the compatibility is mostly to allow 4.2 extensions to run under 4.4, which should be possible _without_ registering a compatibility method.)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107167#pullrequestreview-2904240289","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107167","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-06-06T08:43:43Z"},{"id":3432564841,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MmMhp","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107167#pullrequestreview-3432564841","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107167","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-07T09:34:27Z"},{"id":3480276621,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7PcM6N","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"I think compatibility breakage in this scenario is warranted, but hearing some second opinions would be nice","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107167#pullrequestreview-3480276621","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107167","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-19T00:58:38Z"},{"id":3502355929,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QwbXZ","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"As long as the compatibility breakage is deemed acceptable, I approve of this.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107167#pullrequestreview-3502355929","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107167","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T21:49:59Z"},{"id":3505569316,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q8r4k","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?u=0565b5d99d54afd5fda6712cd8eb05893572baed&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","login":"dalexeev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev"},"body":"This is a fairly small change, which amusingly requires quite a bit of boilerplate (but is still valid and worth noting). I don't think many users were concerned about the method returning `int` instead of `ScriptExportMode`, much less be affected by this change.\r\n\r\nIn terms of compatibility, in GDScript `int` is compatible with any enum, so narrowing the return value of a non-virtual method should be safe.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107167#pullrequestreview-3505569316","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107167","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-25T15:12:53Z"}]